e-decision-system/" class="text-skin-accent inline-block text-lg font-medium decoration-dashed underline-offset-4 focus-visible:no-underline focus-visible:underline-offset-0"><h2 style="view-transition-name:the-decision-system" class="text-lg font-medium decoration-dashed hover:underline">The Decision System</h2></a><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5 text-xs tabular-nums"><span class="text-skin-base/50 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">Part of</span><span class="text-skin-accent font-medium">Five Systems of Engineering Management</span><span class="text-skin-base/40">·</span><span class="text-skin-base/60">6<!-- --> of <!-- -->7</span></div><p class="mt-3">Who decides, how decisions get recorded and what a strategy actually commits you to.</p></li><li class="my-6"><a href="/posts/ems-the-information-system/" class="text-skin-accent inline-block text-lg font-medium decoration-dashed underline-offset-4 focus-visible:no-underline focus-visible:underline-offset-0"><h2 style="view-transition-name:the-information-system" class="text-lg font-medium decoration-dashed hover:underline">The Information System</h2></a><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5 text-xs tabular-nums"><span class="text-skin-base/50 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">Part of</span><span class="text-skin-accent font-medium">Five Systems of Engineering Management</span><span class="text-skin-base/40">·</span><span class="text-skin-base/60">5<!-- --> of <!-- -->7</span></div><p class="mt-3">Drivers, documentation, managing upward and metrics as signal.</p></li><li class="my-6"><a href="/posts/ems-the-delivery-system/" class="text-skin-accent inline-block text-lg font-medium decoration-dashed underline-offset-4 focus-visible:no-underline focus-visible:underline-offset-0"><h2 style="view-transition-name:the-delivery-system" class="text-lg font-medium decoration-dashed hover:underline">The Delivery System</h2></a><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wr